---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="M221Tech | Useful digital products from local data"
  description="M221Tech builds useful digital products from local data across sports, nutrition and open data."
>
  <section class="m221-hero">
    <div class="m221-container">
      <span class="m221-kicker">M221Tech · Local data products</span>
      <h1>M221Tech builds useful digital products from local data.</h1>
      <p>We turn overlooked local data into focused products people can actually use — starting with sports and nutrition.</p>
      <div class="m221-actions">
        <a class="m221-btn m221-btn-primary" href="#products">Explore our products</a>
        <a class="m221-btn m221-btn-secondary" href="#contact">Contact M221Tech</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m221-section" id="products">
    <div class="m221-container">
      <div class="m221-section-head">
        <h2>What we build</h2>
        <p class="m221-section-intro">Focused product verticals where local data can create real, practical value.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="m221-grid-2">
        <article class="m221-card">
          <span class="m221-pill">Sports</span>
          <h3>Sports data products</h3>
          <p>Structured football data and digital experiences for competitions that deserve better coverage.</p>
          <a class="m221-card-link" href="/sports/">Explore Sports →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="m221-card">
          <span class="m221-pill">Nutrition</span>
          <h3>Nutrition data products</h3>
          <p>Product and nutrition data for foods people actually find, buy and consume locally.</p>
          <a class="m221-card-link" href="/nutrition/">Explore Nutrition →</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m221-section">
    <div class="m221-container m221-statement">
      <span class="m221-kicker">Why M221Tech</span>
      <h2>Local data deserves better products.</h2>
      <p>Too much useful local information is scattered, difficult to access or never structured at all. M221Tech turns that gap into focused products built around real local use.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m221-section" id="open">
    <div class="m221-container">
      <div class="m221-section-head">
        <h2>Open & reports</h2>
        <p class="m221-section-intro">Some of the value created by our data work should extend beyond our own products.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="m221-grid-2">
        <article class="m221-card">
          <span class="m221-pill">Open Data</span>
          <h3>Selected public datasets</h3>
          <p>Datasets made available for reuse, research and exploration, including publications on Kaggle.</p>
          <a class="m221-card-link" href="/open/#data">Explore datasets →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="m221-card">
          <span class="m221-pill">Reports</span>
          <h3>Data-driven reports on request</h3>
          <p>Focused analyses prepared from our datasets and product work for specific questions or use cases.</p>
          <a class="m221-card-link" href="mailto:m221tech@gmail.com?subject=M221Tech%20report%20request">Request a report →</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m221-section">
    <div class="m221-container">
      <div class="m221-section-head">
        <h2>Proof in numbers</h2>
        <p class="m221-section-intro">A simple snapshot of the current M221Tech product portfolio. Product-level data metrics will be added as they are verified.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="m221-metrics">
        <div class="m221-metric"><strong>3</strong><span>active products</span></div>
        <div class="m221-metric"><strong>2</strong><span>product verticals</span></div>
        <div class="m221-metric"><strong>1</strong><span>lab project</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m221-section" id="lab">
    <div class="m221-container">
      <div class="m221-section-head">
        <h2>From the lab</h2>
        <p class="m221-section-intro">Experiments and ideas we are exploring before they become full products or product verticals.</p>
      </div>

      <article class="m221-lab">
        <span class="m221-pill">Culture & local knowledge</span>
        <h3>Kurel Facts</h3>
        <p>An experimental data project exploring structured cultural observations and visual analysis.</p>
        <a href="https://kurel.m221.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore Kurel Facts →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m221-contact" id="contact">
    <div class="m221-container">
      <span class="m221-kicker">Contact</span>
      <h2>Have a project, data need or report in mind?</h2>
      <p>Tell us what you are working on. We can discuss a collaboration, a data need or a report request.</p>
      <div class="m221-actions">
        <a class="m221-btn m221-btn-primary" href="mailto:m221tech@gmail.com">Contact M221Tech</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
